25	Weft repo — spec-driven AI orchestration on jj (the loom) + beads (the warp/brain).
26	
27	Entry skills:
28	  /weft-new-project <desc> — plan a greenfield project into the warp (adaptive Q&A + research → an approved warp-plan).
29	  /weft-feature <desc>     — lightweight front door for incremental work on this existing codebase (one epic + picks, in minutes).
